### Wallet Core

@walletHost = http://localhost:8080

### List clients
GET {{walletHost}}/clients

### Create client
POST {{walletHost}}/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice Smith",
  "email": "alice@example.com"
}

### List accounts
GET {{walletHost}}/accounts

### Create account
POST {{walletHost}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client_id": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
}

### Get seeded account from
GET {{walletHost}}/accounts/aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa

### Get seeded account to
GET {{walletHost}}/accounts/bbbbbbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb

### Create transaction (publishes Kafka events)
POST {{walletHost}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account_from_id": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa",
  "account_to_id": "bbbbbbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb",
  "amount": 50
}

### Balances Service

@balancesHost = http://localhost:3003

### Health check
GET {{balancesHost}}/health

### Get balance for account from
GET {{balancesHost}}/balances/aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa

### Get balance for account to
GET {{balancesHost}}/balances/bbbbbbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb

### Get balance not found
GET {{balancesHost}}/balances/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
